{"seq":2,"slug":"cryptography-vpn-technology","title":"密码学与VPN技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-security-defense/cryptography-vpn-technology","wordCount":1873,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"密码学与vpn技术\">密码学与VPN技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>密码学是网络安全的数学基石，为数据传输提供机密性、完整性、身份认证和不可否认性四大安全属性。VPN（虚拟专用网络）则是密码学在网络工程中最直接的工程应用——通过加密隧道在公共网络上构建安全的私有通信通道。掌握加密算法原理和VPN配置部署是网络安全工程师的硬核技能。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对称加密与非对称加密\">对称加密与非对称加密</h3><p><strong>对称加密</strong>：加密和解密使用相同的密钥，运算速度快，适合大数据量传输加密。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>密钥长度</th>\n<th>分组大小</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AES-128</td>\n<td>128 bit</td>\n<td>128 bit</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>通用加密</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AES-256</td>\n<td>256 bit</td>\n<td>128 bit</td>\n<td>高安全</td>\n<td>机密数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ChaCha20</td>\n<td>256 bit</td>\n<td>流密码</td>\n<td>高安全</td>\n<td>移动设备/TLS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3DES</td>\n<td>168 bit</td>\n<td>64 bit</td>\n<td>逐步淘汰</td>\n<td>遗留系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>AES加密强度评估：暴力破解128位密钥需要的计算量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>128</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{128}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">128</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次运算。假设全球最快超算算力为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{18}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次/秒：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>128</mn></msup><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>18</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.4</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>20</mn></msup><mtext> 秒</mtext><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>13</mn></msup><mtext> 年</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{brute} = \\frac{2^{128}}{10^{18}} \\approx 3.4 \\times 10^{20} \\text{ 秒} \\approx 10^{13} \\text{ 年}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">18</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">128</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">20</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">秒</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">13</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>远超宇宙年龄（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.38</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.38 \\times 10^{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.38</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 年），因此AES-128在经典计算模型下被视为安全。</p>\n<p><strong>非对称加密</strong>：使用公钥加密、私钥解密（或私钥签名、公钥验签），解决了密钥分发问题但计算开销远高于对称加密。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as &quot;发送方Alice&quot;&#10;    participant B as &quot;接收方Bob&quot;&#10;    Note over B: 生成密钥对(公钥PK_B, 私钥SK_B)&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;A: 发送公钥 PK_B&#10;    Note over A: 用PK_B加密消息M&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;B: 发送密文 C = Enc(PK_B, M)&#10;    Note over B: 用SK_B解密 M = Dec(SK_B, C)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as \"发送方Alice\"\n    participant B as \"接收方Bob\"\n    Note over B: 生成密钥对(公钥PK_B, 私钥SK_B)\n    B-&gt;&gt;A: 发送公钥 PK_B\n    Note over A: 用PK_B加密消息M\n    A-&gt;&gt;B: 发送密文 C = Enc(PK_B, M)\n    Note over B: 用SK_B解密 M = Dec(SK_B, C)</pre><p>主流非对称算法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RSA</strong>：基于大整数分解困难性，密钥≥2048位才安全</li>\n<li><strong>ECC（椭圆曲线）</strong>：相同安全级别下密钥更短（256位ECC ≈ 3072位RSA），适合资源受限设备</li>\n<li><strong>DH（Diffie-Hellman）密钥交换</strong>：在不安全信道上协商共享密钥，是TLS和IPSec的基础</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>混合加密体制</strong>：实际应用中结合两者优势——用非对称加密交换会话密钥，然后用对称加密传输数据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数字证书与pki体系\">数字证书与PKI体系</h3><p>数字证书将公钥与实体身份绑定，由受信任的证书颁发机构（CA）签名背书，是互联网身份认证的信任锚点。</p>\n<p><strong>X.509证书结构</strong>包含：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>证书版本、序列号</li>\n<li>签名算法标识</li>\n<li>颁发者（Issuer）信息</li>\n<li>有效期（Not Before / Not After）</li>\n<li>使用者（Subject）信息</li>\n<li>使用者公钥</li>\n<li>CA的数字签名</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>PKI信任链验证</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ROOT[&quot;根CA证书&lt;br/&gt;自签名,预置于OS/浏览器&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;签发&quot;| ICA[&quot;中间CA证书&lt;br/&gt;由根CA签名&quot;]&#10;    ICA --&gt;|&quot;签发&quot;| LEAF[&quot;终端实体证书&lt;br/&gt;www.example.com&quot;]&#10;    LEAF --&gt;|&quot;证书链验证&quot;| CLIENT[&quot;客户端&lt;br/&gt;验证签名链完整性&quot;]\">graph TD\n    ROOT[\"根CA证书&lt;br/&gt;自签名,预置于OS/浏览器\"] --&gt;|\"签发\"| ICA[\"中间CA证书&lt;br/&gt;由根CA签名\"]\n    ICA --&gt;|\"签发\"| LEAF[\"终端实体证书&lt;br/&gt;www.example.com\"]\n    LEAF --&gt;|\"证书链验证\"| CLIENT[\"客户端&lt;br/&gt;验证签名链完整性\"]</pre><p>证书验证过程：客户端收到服务器证书 → 检查有效期 → 沿证书链向上验证每一级签名 → 直到找到本地信任存储中的根CA → 检查证书吊销状态（CRL/OCSP）。</p>\n<p><strong>证书生命周期管理</strong>是企业PKI运营的核心挑战：证书到期未续签导致的服务中断是常见的生产事故。自动化证书管理工具（如Let&#39;s Encrypt + certbot、HashiCorp Vault）可实现证书的自动申请、部署和续期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ipsec-vpn隧道\">IPSec VPN隧道</h3><p>IPSec是在网络层（IP层）提供安全通信的协议框架，是站点到站点VPN和远程接入VPN的核心技术。</p>\n<p><strong>IPSec协议组件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>IKE（Internet Key Exchange）</strong>：自动协商安全参数和密钥交换（Phase 1建立管理SA，Phase 2建立数据SA）</li>\n<li><strong>ESP（Encapsulating Security Payload）</strong>：提供加密+认证（协议号50）</li>\n<li><strong>AH（Authentication Header）</strong>：仅提供认证不加密（协议号51，较少使用）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>IPSec两种封装模式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>加密范围</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>传输模式</td>\n<td>仅加密IP载荷</td>\n<td>主机到主机</td>\n<td>+20-37字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>隧道模式</td>\n<td>加密整个原始IP包</td>\n<td>网关到网关(Site-to-Site)</td>\n<td>+40-57字节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>隧道模式下的数据包结构：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>新IP头</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>ESP头</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>原始IP头</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>原始数据</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>ESP尾</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>ESP认证</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\text{新IP头}][\\text{ESP头}][\\text{原始IP头}][\\text{原始数据}][\\text{ESP尾}][\\text{ESP认证}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新</span><span class=\"mord\">IP</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">头</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ESP</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">头</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原始</span><span class=\"mord\">IP</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">头</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原始数据</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ESP</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">尾</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ESP</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">认证</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>IKE Phase 1协商参数（ISAKMP SA）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>加密算法：AES-256-CBC</li>\n<li>哈希算法：SHA-256（用于完整性校验）</li>\n<li>DH组：Group 14（2048位）或Group 20（ECC 384位）</li>\n<li>认证方式：预共享密钥（PSK）或数字证书</li>\n<li>SA生存时间：默认86400秒（24小时）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ssl-vpn远程接入\">SSL VPN远程接入</h3><p>SSL VPN基于TLS协议在传输层建立加密通道，相比IPSec VPN的优势在于无需安装专用客户端软件，通过浏览器即可接入。</p>\n<p><strong>SSL VPN工作模式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Web代理模式</strong>：通过浏览器访问内部Web应用，无需安装任何软件</li>\n<li><strong>端口转发模式</strong>：通过Java/ActiveX控件将特定TCP端口转发到内部服务器</li>\n<li><strong>网络扩展模式（Full Tunnel）</strong>：安装虚拟网卡，获得内网IP地址，实现完整的网络层接入</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>TLS 1.3握手优化</strong>：</p>\n<p>TLS 1.3将握手从2-RTT缩减到1-RTT，支持0-RTT恢复（以少量前向安全性为代价换取极低延迟）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mtext>（TLS 1.3）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{connection} = T_{TCP} + T_{TLS} = 1RTT + 1RTT = 2RTT \\text{（TLS 1.3）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nn</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">TLS 1.3</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>T</mi><mtext>（TLS 1.2）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{connection} = T_{TCP} + T_{TLS} = 1RTT + 2RTT = 3RTT \\text{（TLS 1.2）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">co</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">nn</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">TLS 1.2</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"后量子密码学展望\">后量子密码学展望</h3><p>量子计算机的Shor算法理论上可以在多项式时间内破解RSA和ECC等基于整数分解/离散对数的非对称加密算法。NIST已于2024年发布首批后量子密码标准：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ML-KEM（CRYSTALS-Kyber）</strong>：基于格密码学的密钥封装机制，用于取代RSA/ECDH密钥交换</li>\n<li><strong>ML-DSA（CRYSTALS-Dilithium）</strong>：基于格密码学的数字签名，用于取代RSA/ECDSA签名</li>\n<li><strong>SLH-DSA（SPHINCS+）</strong>：基于哈希的数字签名，作为备选方案</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当前的**密码敏捷性（Crypto Agility）**策略要求新系统设计时预留算法可替换接口，为未来向PQC迁移做好准备。混合模式（Hybrid）在过渡期同时使用传统算法和PQC算法，确保即使PQC算法出现漏洞也有传统算法兜底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>&quot;先存储后解密&quot;（Harvest Now, Decrypt Later）攻击已成为现实威胁——攻击者当前截获加密数据并存储，等待未来量子计算机成熟后再解密。这迫使处理高敏感数据（政府、金融、医疗）的组织提前启动向PQC的迁移。</p>\n<p>WireGuard作为新一代VPN协议以极简设计（仅4000行代码）和现代密码学套件（ChaCha20 + Curve25519 + BLAKE2s）获得了广泛采用，已进入Linux内核主线，成为IPSec和OpenVPN之外的第三选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>使用OpenSSL命令行工具完成以下操作：生成RSA-2048密钥对、创建CSR证书请求、自签名生成CA证书、签发终端证书</li>\n<li>在两台路由器之间配置IPSec VPN隧道（IKEv2, AES-256, SHA-256, DH Group 14），验证隧道建立和流量加密效果</li>\n<li>计算题：某VPN隧道使用ESP隧道模式+AES-256-CBC+SHA-256，原始IP包大小为1400字节，计算封装后的报文总大小</li>\n<li>对比分析IPSec VPN和SSL VPN在部署复杂度、安全性、用户体验和适用场景方面的差异，为某远程办公企业推荐方案</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>密码学为网络安全提供了数学保障的信任基础——对称加密保护数据机密性，非对称加密解决密钥分发和身份认证，数字证书和PKI建立了互联网的信任体系。IPSec VPN和SSL VPN分别满足站点互联和远程接入两大场景的安全通信需求。面对量子计算的潜在威胁，后量子密码学正在为密码体系的下一次根本性升级做准备，网络安全工程师需要保持对密码学演进的持续关注。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"密码学与VPN技术","id":"密码学与vpn技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"对称加密与非对称加密","id":"对称加密与非对称加密"},{"level":3,"text":"数字证书与PKI体系","id":"数字证书与pki体系"},{"level":3,"text":"IPSec VPN隧道","id":"ipsec-vpn隧道"},{"level":3,"text":"SSL VPN远程接入","id":"ssl-vpn远程接入"},{"level":3,"text":"后量子密码学展望","id":"后量子密码学展望"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"防火墙与入侵检测","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-security-defense/firewall-intrusion-detection"},"next":{"title":"安全运营与应急响应","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-security-defense/security-operations-response"}}